00:05:05.280 --> 00:05:07.580
But it is something in New York City.

00:05:07.580 --> 00:05:13.010
I found that, quote, All borough offices are
equipped with ballot marking devices available

00:05:13.010 --> 00:05:15.990
for voters up until Election Day.

00:05:15.990 --> 00:05:17.590
Look it up in your community.

00:05:17.590 --> 00:05:21.120
Remember, they want to take everything away
